      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Conventional slow thermal or low-temperature solution treatments allow differential reduction and diffusion and therefore often produce multiphase or segregated structures.",
